    "method": "Daily cross-sectional Spearman correlation between t factor and t+1 close-to-close return; dates require at least 8 valid instruments. Full sample was evaluated across 1,992 dates and 15 instruments. Recent 2026-07-16 to 2027-10-18 slice was also checked (328 dates; IC -0.021706, ICIR -0.073601), so the factor is regime-sensitive and should be blended conservatively rather than used alone.",
